; derived from photos of old plans of the old mine with the new mine below in Barrio de Arriba, Rio Tuerto.
; the plans are of an unknown date so the workings of the new mine may be more extensive
; heights in metres but related to a datum of 70 metres below sea level and given to 1 centimetre
; in the survey the two mines are connected by a false vertical at station 22 where they cross
; bearings are geographical
; gradient data not available in most places - in the new mine the main passage is horizontal
